<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Trust sees 97/98 oper profits at Y100 bln.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Trust sees 97/98 oper profits at Y100 bln.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsui Trust &amp; Banking Co Ltd said on Monday it expects to post a parent operating profit of 100 billion yen in the current business year to March 31, 1998, compared with 94.71 billion yen in fiscal 1996/97.</p>
<p>The forecast was revealed by a senior Mitsui official after the bank announced its results for 1996/97.</p>
<p>The bank recorded 67.28 billion yen in operating profits in 1995/96.</p>
</text>
